nikita-k (nikita-k) sent /newmotd Welcome to new version of the killer, 1.99.9!
News in this version
Fixed the client side message of the day system
Added doors and auto moovers
1 new sound of death
Jail added!
Now when you sit down, another sound plays, also, the sound plays when you get up
Changed the sound of connecting to the game
2 new welcome sounds
Changed the auction sounds, online and offline sounds, and the team message sound
Redesigned the voting system
Added sounds when you set and remove the admin or builder flag
Added a sound when you delete the map
New sounds of animal cutting
Added map loading sounds
The new sound of opening and closing inventory
Added a readme! Note, it is not yet fully ready, as long as only the control keys in the game are written there
Changed the sounds of falling
Added other sounds of blood when hitting the character
Added extra sound when the character dies
